# Approach : Loop Traversal 
## Difficulty : Easy
# Time Complexity : O(n x m )
# Space Complexity : O(1)



`python []

class Solution(object):
    def longestCommonPrefix(self, strs):
      prefix=strs[0]
      for chars in strs:
        while not chars.startswith(prefix):
            prefix=prefix[:-1]
      return prefix





Input
strs =
["flower","flow","flight"]
Output
"fl"
